# Android app configuration template (Secrets Gradle Plugin).
#
# SECURITY NOTE (Phase 8.7-C):
# This file feeds the Android app's BuildConfig. Values compiled into the APK
# are recoverable from the distributed artifact and MUST NOT include reusable
# provider secrets. GEMINI_API_KEY has been REMOVED from the app:
#
#   * Android-distributed applications cannot keep a reusable provider secret
#     confidential.
#   * The app sends analysis requests to the authenticated platform backend
#     (a non-secret endpoint URL), which calls Gemini server-side.
#   * The Gemini key belongs in the SERVER-SIDE environment of the platform
#     (devops-ai-platform / backend services), never in this file.
#
# No key means the app truthfully runs its offline template engine (no live
# AI) instead of falling back to a bundled credential.
